msgid ""
"vllm-ascend uses the following environment variables to configure the "
"system:"
msgstr "vllm-ascend 使用以下环境变量来配置系统："

#: ../../source/user_guide/configuration/env_vars.md:5
msgid ""
"**Note:** Some environment variables are being migrated to `--additional-"
"config` options. These environment variables are still supported during the "
"migration period, and it is recommended to use `--additional-config` for new"
" deployments. See [Additional Configuration](additional_config.md) for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"**注意：** 部分环境变量正在迁移至 `--additional-config` 选项。迁移期间这些环境变量仍受支持，建议新部署使用 "
"`--additional-config`。详情请参见[附加配置](additional_config.md)。"
